        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FitzGerald’s are delighted to bring to the market this bright two-storey, semi-detached property for sale by private treaty. Located in the centre of Kilmanagh village, this property is within walking distance to St. Aidan’s primary school, Church of Our Lady, Queen of Peace, Graigue-Ballycallan GAA club and Tirlán farm shop. It’s within a 5-minute drive from Ballykeeffe Amphitheatre and Wood while being a 10-minute drive from Callan, and a 20-minute from Kilkenny City Centre. \r\n\r\nThis property has been tastefully decorated throughout, providing an inviting atmosphere to a family home with accommodation laid out over two floors.  The ground floor comprises of an entrance hall, large open plan sitting / dining room with a solid fuel stove and French doors leading to the back patio, spacious kitchen, utility room and downstairs bathroom. Upstairs comprises of three double bedrooms, a single bedroom and family bathroom. Externally, this property benefits from a private patio with a detached shed and paved front garden.  \r\n\r\nThis spacious home has been well maintained over the years and presents a fantastic opportunity to purchase a home in the countryside while enjoying proximity to a range of amenities. It’s ideally suited for first-time buyers, a family home or an investment property.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all the property offers. \r\n\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION \r\nGROUND FLOOR \r\nENTRANCE HALL\t\t        3.8m x 1.7m \twith laminate flooring.\r\nSITTING / DINING ROOM\t7.5m x 3.4m\twith laminate flooring and solid fuel stove.\r\nCONSERVATORY\t\t        2.6m x 1.8m\twith French doors leading to the garden.\r\nKITCHEN\t\t                2.5m x 4.6m\twith fitted units.\r\nUTILITY\t\t                        2.6m x 4.6m\twith fitted cabinets and double doors to the front.\r\nDOWNSTAIRS WC\t\t        1.4m x 1.7m\twith WC, WHC and shower.\r\nREAR PORCH\t\t        2.0m x 1.9m\t \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR \r\nLANDING\t\t\t       3.0m x 2.0m\twith hot press and attic stairs. \r\nBEDROOM 1 \t\t\t       4.8m x 3.6m\twith 4 bay fitted wardrobes.\r\nBEDROOM 2 \t\t\t       3.3m x 3.1m\twith 4 bay fitted wardrobes.\r\nBEDROOM 3 \t\t\t       4.2m x 2.5m\twith carpet.\r\nBEDROOM 4 \t\t\t       4.6m x 2.6m\twith carpet.\r\nBATHROOM\t\t       \t       2.0m x 1.7m\twith WC, WHB and bath.\r\nTOTAL AREA\t\t\t       144m2 / 1550ft2\r\n\r\nSERVICES \t                      Mains Water and Drainage, ESB, Telephone, dual fuel heating (oil-fired & back boiler), uPVC double glazed windows."
      },
